{
  "id": "MIME-677.8",
  "title": "decrypt.rs: UnsupportedAlgorithm used for 'not EnvelopedData' — wrong error variant",
  "description": "In decrypt.rs line 31, when the ContentInfo content_type is not EnvelopedData, the error returned is SmimeError::UnsupportedAlgorithm(\"not EnvelopedData\"). This is semantically wrong: the content type is not an algorithm. A reader diagnosing an error from the field will be confused by an UnsupportedAlgorithm message containing the string 'not EnvelopedData'. Should use SmimeError::Io or a more specific variant.",
  "status": "closed",
